          "en": "In the classic image a young traveller with a bundle and a white rose strolls toward a cliff while a small dog yaps at his heels. Numbered 0, he stands outside the sequence yet runs through all of it — the Major Arcana is often read as \"the Fool's Journey\", and the other 21 cards are what he meets along the way."
