          "en": "Water (modern: Neptune)"
        },
        "archetype": {
          "zh": "一个人头下脚上地倒挂在 T 形树上，一条腿弯成「4」字，神情平静，头后有光环。这不是刑罚，而是主动的暂停：通过放下与等待换来顿悟。",
          "en": "A man hangs upside down from a T-shaped tree, one leg crossed into a \"4\", face serene, a halo behind his head. It isn't punishment but a chosen pause: insight gained by letting go and waiting."
        }
      },
